    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Solar Energy is a modern, performance-focused WordPress theme designed for solar companies, renewable energy providers, installers, and eco-friendly businesses. With a clean, high-contrast layout and bold typography, it helps you showcase services like solar panel installation, energy solutions, maintenance, and commercial projects with clarity and impact. The theme features professionally designed sections making it easy to build trust and generate leads. Its responsive design ensures a seamless experience across all devices while maintaining a premium, conversion-focused appearance. Whether you're creating a website for a local solar installer or a large renewable energy company, ST Solar Energy provides a reliable and scalable foundation."
    },
